[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3966516975","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116791#issuecomment-3966516975","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116791","id":3966516975,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sbD7v","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-26T13:06:59Z","updated_at":"2026-02-26T13:07:13Z","body":"This is very good. My team and I are currently heavily dependent on a sloppy script for achieving UGUI-style auto-sizing, and we're really looking forward to having it built in.\r\n\r\n*That script just in case anyone may need it:*\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool class_name AutoSizeLabel extends Label\r\n\r\n@export var max_width: int = 400:\r\n\tget:\r\n\t\treturn max_width\r\n\tset(value):\r\n\t\tmax_width = value;\r\n\t\t_draw();\r\n\r\n@export var expand_to_text_width: bool = false:\r\n\tget:\r\n\t\treturn expand_to_text_width\r\n\tset(value):\r\n\t\texpand_to_text_width = value;\r\n\t\t_draw();\r\n\r\n@export var min_size: int = 0:\r\n\tget:\r\n\t\treturn min_size\r\n\tset(value):\r\n\t\tmin_size = value;\r\n\t\t_draw();\r\n\r\n@export var max_size: int = 16:\r\n\tget:\r\n\t\treturn max_size\r\n\tset(value):\r\n\t\tmax_size = value;\r\n\t\t_draw();\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tsize = Vector2.ZERO;\r\n\r\nfunc _draw() -> void:\r\n\tsize = Vector2.ZERO;\r\n\t# Calculate an appropriate font size based on the text width\r\n\t# Start with the maximum size and decrease towards min_size until it fits within max_width\r\n\t# if the text width for min_size still exceeds max_width, set to min_size\r\n\t# if min_size is larger than max_size, set to max_size\r\n\t\r\n\tvar displayed_text := text;\r\n\tif visible_characters >= 0 && !expand_to_text_width:\r\n\t\tdisplayed_text = text.substr(0, visible_characters);\r\n\t\r\n\t# Ensure min_size doesn't exceed max_size\r\n\tvar effective_min_size = min(min_size, max_size);\r\n\tvar effective_max_size := max_size;\r\n\t\r\n\t# Start from max_size and work down to find the largest font size that fits\r\n\tvar font := get_theme_font(\"font\");\r\n\tvar best_size = effective_min_size;\r\n\t\r\n\tfor font_size in range(effective_max_size, effective_min_size - 1, -1):\r\n\t\tvar text_size := font.get_string_size(displayed_text, horizontal_alignment, -1, font_size, justification_flags, text_direction as TextServer.Direction);\r\n\t\tif text_size.x <= max_width:\r\n\t\t\tbest_size = font_size;\r\n\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\r\n\t# Apply the calculated font size\r\n\tadd_theme_font_size_override(\"font_size\", best_size);\r\n\t\r\n\t# Set custom minimum size based on actual text dimensions\r\n\tvar final_text_size := font.get_string_size(displayed_text, horizontal_alignment, -1, best_size, justification_flags, text_direction as TextServer.Direction);\r\n\tcustom_minimum_size = Vector2(min(final_text_size.x, max_width), 0);\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3966516975/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977952022","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116791#issuecomment-3977952022","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116791","id":3977952022,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tGrsW","user":{"login":"ismailivanov","id":64804972,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0ODA0OTcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64804972?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov","html_url":"https://github.com/ismailivanov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-28T21:37:23Z","updated_at":"2026-02-28T21:37:23Z","body":"> Tested this PR a bit.\r\n> \r\n>     1. Disabling Auto Font Size doesn't revert the font size back to the default.\r\n> \r\n>     2. In my opinion, Min and Max should be spelled out as Minimum and Maximum in the inspector, for accessibility reasons.\r\n> \r\n>     3. When Minimum Font Size > Maximum Font Size, the minimum font size takes precedent. I guess either way is fine, but I expected the opposite. Should be documented in each property's description.\r\n> \r\n>     4. For all the nodes that also have an associated icon or other control that is not technically a font (Button, CheckBox, and CheckButton), I think this implementation is not going to fly. IMO either we strip those node types out of this PR (which I think I'd prefer), or this PR introduces more specialized controls that help manage the icon / addition control sizes in a more encompassing way. I think this PR would stand a higher chance of being merged if it just focussed on Label and RichTextLabel initially, and introduce auto font sizing on other nodes should there be sufficient requests and a more specific proposal that also addresses how icons and other controls part of the parent control should be managed.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSo for now, I'll add this only for Label and RichTextLabel.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977952022/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3978533878","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116791#issuecomment-3978533878","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116791","id":3978533878,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tI5v2","user":{"login":"ismailivanov","id":64804972,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0ODA0OTcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64804972?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov","html_url":"https://github.com/ismailivanov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismailivanov/subscriptions